# /dev/uinput access for logimap's keystroke injector.
#
# Default kernel perms (root:root 0600) prevent userspace from synthesizing
# keys. We grant rw to the `input` group, which is the conventional Linux
# group for input-device access. Add your user with `usermod -aG input $USER`
# (re-login required for the new group to take effect).

KERNEL=="uinput", GROUP="input", MODE="0660", OPTIONS+="static_node=uinput"
